+ see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.87.152","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79608,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1cfe57ab346f1970b0f13b2640ba343","RawContent":"I love this site &amp;amp; thank god i found it.. But at the same damn time I have to read tons just to have my one question answered, but by than I am already thinking of 10 more.. lol\n\n\nWe are planning on October 8 or 9 2016. Reception in JF but not sure on the ceremony. I am completely in love with the gazebo lobby. Not not sure if itll be more $. I am set to invite about 60 ppl but am hoping 2 have a buget of no more than $9000.00 usd does anyone think that is possible? \n\n\nCan i meet ppl who alreay had their wedding at PF and tell me there final price. Plwase help","Attachments":[],"Id":1905221,"PostDate":1442960068,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love this site & thank god i found it.. But at the same damn time I have to read tons just to have my one question answered, but by than I am already thinking of 10 more.. lol<br><br>\nWe are planning on October 8 or 9 2016. Reception in JF but not sure on the ceremony. I am completely in love with the gazebo lobby. Not not sure if itll be more $. I am set to invite about 60 ppl but am hoping 2 have a buget of no more than $9000.00 usd does anyone think that is possible? <br><br>\nCan i meet ppl who alreay had their wedding at PF and tell me there final price. Plwase help \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"campos213@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.9.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441932857,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxMario","Id":284764,"Name":"RoxMario","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.75.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79608,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1642d54a5b6807199f957c9fc1e63113","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community RoxMario and Congrats on your JF wedding coming up in Oct next year!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll find lots of great ideas, suggestions, support and advice here, so well done on getting off to a wonderful start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera....to ramp up your creativity - enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11700881_10153435265859487_8330476870717087827_o.jpg\" alt=\"11700881_10153435265859487_8330476870717\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/11357262_10153362917524487_2748914616563138609_o.jpg\" alt=\"11357262_10153362917524487_2748914616563\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_o.jpg\" alt=\"10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905261,"PostDate":1443023127,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community RoxMario and Congrats on your JF wedding coming up in Oct next year!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll find lots of great ideas, suggestions, support and advice here, so well done on getting off to a wonderful start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera....to ramp up your creativity - enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>...taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11700881_10153435265859487_8330476870717087827_o.jpg\" alt=\"11700881_10153435265859487_8330476870717\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/11357262_10153362917524487_2748914616563138609_o.jpg\" alt=\"11357262_10153362917524487_2748914616563\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_o.jpg\" alt=\"10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight