{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.244.52.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79144,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64fe3d3c51a97b625f8807c2a6a7fc5e","RawContent":"We first look at budget and what we wanted to end up spending. Then we talked to the people we couldn&#039;t get married without and let them know we wanted to do destination and spoke to them about what their budget would be to attend. From there we narrowed down countries and cities based on that budget. Then we focused on hotels in those cities that had good packages that fit our budget, as well as our main guest budget and eliminated anything that wentirely above it. Once I narrowed it down to a few different resorts I went to a bridal show and travel show and spoke to the different agents and got their suggestions and what resorts they would choose out of the ones I had narrowed down. I connected with one at a bridal show who got me a geat deal and placed our deposit based on the overwhelming responses about one particular resort.\n\n\nNow to plan everything else lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896948,"PostDate":1432337637,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We first look at budget and what we wanted to end up spending. Then we talked to the people we couldn't get married without and let them know we wanted to do destination and spoke to them about what their budget would be to attend. From there we narrowed down countries and cities based on that budget. Then we focused on hotels in those cities that had good packages that fit our budget, as well as our main guest budget and eliminated anything that wentirely above it. Once I narrowed it down to a few different resorts I went to a bridal show and travel show and spoke to the different agents and got their suggestions and what resorts they would choose out of the ones I had narrowed down. I connected with one at a bridal show who got me a geat deal and placed our deposit based on the overwhelming responses about one particular resort.<br><br>\nNow to plan everything else lol.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"empty_xo@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.244.52.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416701137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brandii","Id":281229,"Name":"Brandii","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.94.109.103","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79144,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d28fc5f8936c9e115f8258f56771a1e6","RawContent":"We started with a guest list of all the people we wanted there and thought would probably come. Then we narrowed down our location and then narrowed down the resorts in that lcoation. Then we tried to come up with a budget based off of the number of guests and the prices of the wedding packages in our top resorts. Next up...pick a resort! which is by far the hardest decision so far! congratulations and good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1897618,"PostDate":1433107966,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We started with a guest list of all the people we wanted there and thought would probably come. Then we narrowed down our location and then narrowed down the resorts in that lcoation. Then we tried to come up with a budget based off of the number of guests and the prices of the wedding packages in our top resorts. Next up...pick a resort! which is by far the hardest decision so far! congratulations and good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaspbri0317@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.58.144.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1296691627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=1429022808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jaspbri0317","Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
